    "en": {
      "trackName": "Block Blast Watch Games",
      "description": "The Ultimate Block Game Collection for Your Wrist\nEnjoy a diverse selection of block puzzles and arcade games designed specifically for your smartwatch. Whether you are commuting or waiting in line, the perfect gaming experience is now on your wrist.\nIncluded Games:\n\t•\tBlock Blast: Strategically clear lines in this addictive puzzle.\n\t•\tClassic Blocks: The timeless falling block challenge.\n\t•\tColor Block: Match colors to eliminate blocks and score high.\n\t•\tBlock Runner: Test your reflexes in a fast-paced parkour challenge.\n\t•\tBlock Crush: Tap and blast groups of blocks to clear the board.\nKey Features:\n\t•\tOptimized for small screens with smooth, intuitive controls.\n\t•\tPlay offline anytime, anywhere.\n\t•\tContinuous updates with new block-themed games being added regularly.",
